  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/03/P1018607.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Dissabte 23 de mar&ccedil;, en el primer acte oficial de les Festes de la Magdalena a Castell&oacute;, se li ha lliurat la distinci&oacute; Fadr&iacute; d&#39;Honor a Lino Traver, alfarer de Ribesalbes, que participa des de fa m&eacute;s de 40 anys al preg&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/fadri-honor-lino-traver-01.jpg\" alt=\"fadri-honor-lino-traver-01\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/fadri-honor-lino-traver-02.jpg\" alt=\"fadri-honor-lino-traver-02\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/p1018605.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/p1018606.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/p1018607.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/p1018617.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/p1018618.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfadrihonor/p1018619.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/linotraverfa